msgid "The spell makes no sound at its point of impact."
msgstr "発動しても呪文の効果範囲内で音は発生しません。"

#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid "This spell is much louder at its point of impact."
msgstr "呪文の効果範囲の中心ほど大きな音が発生します。"

#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The caster must speak in order to cast the spell.  More mouth encumbrannce "
