msgstr "呪文詠唱に手を使いません。詠唱時の手の動作制限にペナルティはありません。"

#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This spell does not require leg movement in order to be cast.  All "
"encumbrance penalties for legs are nullified."
msgstr "呪文詠唱に脚を使いません。詠唱時の脚の動作制限にペナルティはありません。"

#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This spell requires focus to cast.  The lower your focus, the higher failure"
