#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Debugger"
msgstr "デバッガー"

#. ~ Profession (male Debugger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your sole purpose in life is to test mods.  Did you exist before this?  Or "
"were you brought into existence at this moment?  You scream - for you do not"
" know.  (This profession is CHEATING!  Only use it if you're testing code "
"and want to quickly jump in.)"
msgstr ""
"更新した項目のテストを行うことが人生で唯一の目的です。自分は前からここにいたのか？今も確かにここにいるのか？分からない...思わず悲鳴を上げました。(この職業はチートです！すぐにコードのテストを行ないたい場合のみ選択してください)"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Debugger"
msgstr "デバッガー"

#. ~ Profession (female Debugger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
