msgid "Recover Ally, "
msgstr "仲間を呼び戻す: "

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Have a companion attempt to completely dissemble a vehicle into components.\n"
" \n"
"Skill used: mechanics\n"
"Difficulty: 2 \n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Removed parts placed on the furniture in the garage.\n"
