"> 拡張された全ての植え付け可能な地面に種を植えます。\n"
" \n"
"危険: なし\n"
"時間: 1分 / 区画 \n"
"人員: 0/1 \n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Harvest any plants that are ripe and bring the produce back.\n"
" \n"
