#: src/player_display.cpp
msgid ""
"Covering your mouth will make it more difficult to breathe and catch your "
"breath."
msgstr "口を覆うと通常時の呼吸が困難になり、上がった息の回復も遅くなります。"

#: src/player_display.cpp
msgid ""
"Arm encumbrance affects stamina cost of melee attacks and accuracy with "
