#, c-format
msgid "Reduces aim speed of guns by %.1f."
msgstr "銃器の照準速度%.1f"

#: src/player_display.cpp
msgid ""
"Strength affects your melee damage, the amount of weight you can carry, your"
" total HP, your resistance to many diseases, and the effectiveness of "
"actions which require brute force."
msgstr "近接攻撃の威力、持ち運べる最大重量、最大HP、病への抵抗力や腕力が必要な行動に影響します。"

